<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry and demand was fair.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed for the week to date on 7,800 head, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
